== Effects ==
* Duplicates all pickups and chests in the room.
** This includes pickups for sale in the {{r|Shop}}; the duplicates can then be picked up for free.

== Notes ==
* Cannot duplicate other '''Jera''' runes and [[trinkets]].
* Duplicated chests will contain exactly the same type of items: if the original contains a pickup, so will the duplicate.

== Strategy ==
* If obtained later in the run, it is recommended to keep it for the {{s|Chest}} / {{s|Dark Room}}, as their first rooms always contain 4 chests that can be duplicated.
** {{dlc|r}} If '''Jera''' is used in the starting room of the Dark room, the newly spawned {{e|Red Chest}}s will contain four additional and distinct devil deals.

== Synergies ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth|nr}}: Quadruples all pickups and chests in the room.
* {{p|Wild Card}}: '''Jera''' can duplicate the Wild card, allowing for infinite duplication on the room's pickups.

== Interactions ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth|r}}: No effect.
* {{i|D20}}: Rerolling duplicated pickups will result in both the original item and the duplicate being rerolled into the exact same pickup.
* {{i|Diplopia}}: Does not duplicate '''Jera'''.
* {{i|Hypercoagulation}}: Duplicating temporary hearts makes the duplicates permanent.
* {{e|Mom's Chest}}: Cannot be duplicated by '''Jera'''.

